/* global THREE */
/* Day 6 (NCC Parade). Stages are cinematic overlays registered as window.__day2.parade(stage, done):
   uniform  - inspection: tap and fix 4 faults, then hold "attention"
   drill    - fall in, then answer the Colonel's commands (Savdhan / Vishram / Daayen / Baayen / Peeche Mud)
   run      - 3D NCC ground run: 1.4 km (2 runs of 700 m) in 2:00, cadets cheer the player's name
   flag     - hoist the flag at the anthem's pace (pull / release), then hold the salute
   debrief  - scorecard + certificate saved to the BAG
   Everything is touch-first (big buttons, pointerdown) and also works with the keyboard. Scores: localStorage 'anits-parade'. */
